234
00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:06.330
Aga mis siis siis,
kui ma oleks praegu näiteks

235
00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:08.505
Ko.

236
00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:11.640
Ku.

237
00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:13.890
Misko.

238
00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:17.400
Kokutama hakanud.

239
00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:21.050
Rein aga Rein, sa ju kokutadki.

240
00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.180
Ma ma.

241
00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:29.180
Ma, ma siis.

242
00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:31.505
Niimoodi.

243
00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:36.170
Puta järele.

244
00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:38.450
